  (text "KET NOI MODULE CAM BIEN (tat ca nuoi tu VSENS, chi bat khi do)\nJ4: module do am dat dien dung v1.2/v2.0 (TLC555), day PH2.0-3P: 1=GND 2=VCC 3=AOUT.\n    Chon module dung TLC555 (NE555 khong chay o 3.3V). AOUT 0-3V -> R12 -> IO1 (ATTEN 12dB).\nJ6: module I2C SHT4x/SHT3x/AHT20 (GY-xxx): 1=VIN 2=GND 3=SCL 4=SDA.\nJ7: dau do NTC 10k chong nuoc (tuy chon) -> nhiet do dat. U3: TVS cho day ra ngoai hop."
    (at 20.32 27.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 88e61b26-a9c1-532b-bd09-ac3ca0991c2b)
  )
  (text "Pull-up I2C noi VSENS: firmware dat SDA/SCL Hi-Z (khong pull) truoc khi ngu.\nNeu module I2C co LED nguon, nen go LED de giam dong khi do."
    (at 20.32 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 2d1c13c0-2b6b-5f9d-9d4a-53a534e4f382)
  )
)
